d class=\"td-4\">15<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-5\">Vertical coal grinding mill<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-6\">16<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-last td-7\">Bag filter for coal grinding plant<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"tr-even tr-4\">\n<td class=\"td-0\">17<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-1\">Tubular cooler<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-2\">18<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-3\">Bag filter for clinker cooler<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-4\">19<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-5\">Clinker cooler<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-6\">20<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-last td-7\">Rotary kiln<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"tr-odd tr-5\">\n<td class=\"td-0\">21<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-1\">Clinker silo<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-2\">22<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-3\">Gypsum<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-4\">23<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-5\">Minerals<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-6\">24<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-last td-7\">Separator<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr class=\"tr-even tr-last\">\n<td class=\"td-0\">25<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-1\">Cement finish mill<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-2\">26<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-3\">Bag filter for cement finish mill<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-4\">27<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-5\">Packaging plant<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-6\">28<\/td>\n<td class=\"td-last td-7\">Palletization plant<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<div class=\"bwfTextImage\">\n<h3>Filtration Solutions Expert \u2013 Philite\u00ae<\/h3>\n<p>Product quality and compliance with dust emission limits are core requirements for dusting in the cement, gypsum and lime industry. The choice of filter media is of paramount importance in cement kilns where there are high NOx levels due to high combustion temperatures. Philite\u00ae filter media range offers for each process in the cement, gypsum and lime industry technically sophisticated solutions.<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Excellent Material Selection<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>The fiber has high strength, good stability andheat resistance.and can be customized ondemand.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4707\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-01-detail4-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"647\" height=\"431\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-01-detail4-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-01-detail4-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Polypropylene-Needle-Filter-Felt-01-detail4.jpg 750w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 647px) 100vw, 647px\" \/><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Lathe Sewing<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>The special stitcher for normal temperature cloth bag shall be selected to seal the edges of three times without disconnection.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4708\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Philite\u00ae-factory-10-detail5-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"643\" height=\"429\" \/><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Supporting Cage Skeleton<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>The supporting cage of dust removal bag iscarefully inspected before leaving the factory.It has high perpendicularity, beautiful andsmooth welding, and there is no open weldingburr, missing welding, etc.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4709\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-Bag-Cages-detail6-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"645\" height=\"430\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-Bag-Cages-detail6-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-Bag-Cages-detail6-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-Bag-Cages-detail6.jpg 750w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 645px) 100vw, 645px\" \/><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Customization<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>According to the customer\u2019s requirements,the products are treated with singeing, roughening, water repellent, covering, etc.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-4710\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-bag-singeing-detail7-300x200.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"648\" height=\"432\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-bag-singeing-detail7-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-bag-singeing-detail7-600x400.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Filter-bag-singeing-detail7.jpg 750w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 648px) 100vw, 648px\" \/><\/p>\n<div class=\"bwfTextImage\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Types of Filter Bags for Cement Plants<\/h3>\n<p>The material selection of filter bags in cement plants usually takes into account their performance requirements in terms of high temperature resistance, corrosion resistance, wear resistance and filtration efficiency. The following are common cement plant filter bag materials:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Polyester (PET)<\/strong>: Polyester fiber is a commonly used filter bag material with good high temperature resistance and chemical stability, and is suitable for the filtration needs of general cement production.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Aramid(Nomex)<\/strong>: Aramid fiber has a dense structure and can effectively capture fine dust particles and improve filtration efficiency. Compared with some other high-temperature fibers, aramid has better hydrolysis resistance and can be used in high-humidity environments.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Acrylic (AC)<\/strong>: Acrylic fiber is usually used to filter chemically corrosive gases in cement plants and has good corrosion resistance.<\/li>\n<li><strong>PTFE (Polytetrafluoroethylene)<\/strong>: PTFE filter bags have excellent high temperature resistance and chemical stability, and are suitable for filtration of high temperature and highly corrosive gases, but the cost is relatively high.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Fiberglass<\/strong>: Glass fiber filter bags have good high temperature resistance and chemical stability, are suitable for high temperature gas filtration, and have high mechanical strength and wear resistance.<\/li>\n<li><strong>PPS (polyphenylene sulfide)<\/strong>: PPS is a synthetic fiber with good high temperature resistance and chemical resistance, suitable for filtration in high temperature flue gas.<\/li>\n<li><strong>P84 (polyamide fiber)<\/strong>: P84 fiber has excellent high temperature resistance and chemical stability, and is suitable for high temperature gas filtration.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Material Specifications<\/h3>\n<table class=\"all magic-9\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-10\" data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2700.details.0.i60.71aa7cebgCvf8q\">Material Fiber<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-11\">Polyester (Dacron)<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-12\">Homopolymer Acrylic<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Aramid (Nomex)<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-14\">Felted Fiberglass<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-13\">Polymid (P84)<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-15\">Polytetraflour ethylene PTFE Membrane(Teflon)<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-16\">Polyphenylene Sulfide(Ryton) PPS<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-10\">Characteristics<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-11\"><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-12\"><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-13\"><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"magic-14\"><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td colspan=\"1\" 